Task: Implement client-side WebSocket hook

Summary: Created React hook for WebSocket client management with reconnection

Files created:
- src/hooks/useMultiplayerSocket.ts - React hook with connect, disconnect, send, on APIs
- src/hooks/useMultiplayerSocket.test.ts - 10 unit tests covering connection, events, cleanup

Features:
- Configurable reconnection with exponential backoff (maxRetries: 3, window: 60s)
- Event listener system for open, close, error, message events
- Automatic cleanup on unmount
- Safe disconnect that prevents automatic reconnection
